WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.978
"I'm going to squash you!" the ogre growled.

2
00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:12.257
He squeezed Puss tightly.

3
00:00:12.258 --> 00:00:15.743
"Ow!" Puss cried.

4
00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:20.861
"Stop—or you won't get my money!"

5
00:00:20.862 --> 00:00:23.587
The ogre stopped squeezing.

6
00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:27.261
"What do you mean?" he asked.

7
00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:30.303
Puss rolled his eyes.

8
00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:34.466
"I can't pay you if you squash me."

9
00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.608
The ogre thought for a moment.

10
00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:41.584
Then he sighed.

11
00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:45.791
"I'll put you down now," the ogre said.

12
00:00:45.792 --> 00:00:50.317
"You won't try to escape again, will you?"

13
00:00:50.318 --> 00:00:53.267
Puss held a paw over his heart.

14
00:00:53.268 --> 00:00:58.820
"Of course not. You can trust me."

15
00:00:58.821 --> 00:01:05.953
The ogre put Puss on the floor.

16
00:01:05.954 --> 00:01:09.729
"I'm sorry I tricked you before," Puss said.

17
00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:13.804
"I didn't believe you could make yourself bigger."

18
00:01:13.805 --> 00:01:17.695
"Well, I can," the ogre bragged.

19
00:01:17.696 --> 00:01:21.816
"I can do lots of amazing things."

20
00:01:21.817 --> 00:01:26.542
"Hmm," Puss said.

21
00:01:26.543 --> 00:01:31.431
"Can you . . . make yourself smaller?"

22
00:01:31.432 --> 00:01:36.028
"Of course!" the ogre said.

23
00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:44.579
Puss gave the ogre a doubtful look.

24
00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.747
"You don't believe me?" the ogre asked.

25
00:01:49.748 --> 00:01:53.698
Puss shrugged. "Eh, not really."

26
00:01:53.699 --> 00:01:57.645
The ogre became angry.

27
00:01:57.646 --> 00:02:03.758
"Watch this!"

28
00:02:03.759 --> 00:02:07.807
The ogre began to shrink.

29
00:02:07.808 --> 00:02:16.407
Soon he was a mouse.

30
00:02:16.408 --> 00:02:25.370
Puss grinned—and pounced!

31
00:02:25.371 --> 00:02:29.638
"Ahh!" the tiny ogre cried.

32
00:02:29.639 --> 00:02:32.146
"Please—"

33
00:02:32.147 --> 00:02:37.101
Gulp!

